useums\nPSL catalog\nDigital collections\nTutorials\nDatabases\nInnovation\nInnovate and transfer\nProtect your innovation\nTransfer your technology\nFind your funding\nInnovation lab & coworking spaces\nEntrepreneurship at PSL\nResearcher entrepreneurs\nResearch lab start-ups\nPSL Tech Seed\nPSL-iTeams\nCorporate relations\nPSL Technology\nOur supports and partners\nEnterprise & Innovation - People\nStudent stories\nThe University Innovation Hub\nLife@PSL\nGet involved\n\"Union PSL\" PSL Student Organization\nPSL Alumni\nStudent organizations\nFunding for clubs & organizations\nOrchestra & Choir\nStudent services\nPSL Housing\nHelpline against harassment and violences\nStudent health service\nPSL Welcome Desk\nMazet Student Life Center\nCampus life in Paris\nFinancial Aid\nDining\nCampus maps & directions\nAthletics\nSee, Explore, Go Out\nInternational\nPSL Global: strategy and international partnerships\nPSL Global Seed Fund: University\u2019s seed fund for its international projects\nThe Guild of European Research-Intensive Universities\nStudy abroad\nDoctoral mobility (Erasmus +)\nFaculty and staff mobility\nStudent mobility\nStudy / teach at PSL\nInternational students: your application at PSL\nWelcome Desk - Researchers\nEuropean University - EELISA\nSchools\nInternational students\nHome\nEducation\nInternational students\nShare :\nFacebook\nLinked in\nPrint\nEmbarking on the journey to study abroad can feel overwhelming, but we\u2019re here to support you every step of the way in turning your dreams into reality. Take the first step with us, and get ready to unlock new possibilities at one of the world\u2019s top universities!\nStep 1 | Explore study opportunities at PSL\nSearch engine\nFind programs based on your specific criteria\nTraining fields map\nExplore our programs across six multidisciplinary training fields\nMaster's taught in English\nDiscover our programs offered entirely or partially in English\nAspiring to pursue a research-oriented career? Explore PSL PhD tracks: a highly selective, fully funded, 5-year Master's-PhD program taught entirely in English.\nStep 2 | Learn about tuition fees at PSL\nAt PSL, you'll receive a world-class education with minimal financial burden. You can find information about tuition fees on each program's page, under the \"Admissions\" tab.\nStep 3 | Explore scholarship opportunities tailored to your study plan\nExplore the multiple scholarship opportunities PSL offers for both French and international students, and find the one that best supports your academic ambitions!\nStep 4 | Get informed about the admissions procedures\nApplication platforms and deadlines at PSL vary depending on your degree program, nationality, and other criteria. Explore our dedicated pages below to find out when, where, and how to apply:\nApply to PSL Bachelorr's programs\nApply to PSL Master's programs\nInternational admissions procedures at PSL\nStep 5 | Discover why PSL is the ideal match for you\nNow that you\u2019ve explored all the exciting opportunities at PSL, you might still have questions: Is PSL the right fit for me? Why study in France? Don\u2019t worry\u2014we\u2019re here to help!\nCheck out our guide to PSL and studying in France to discover what makes PSL exceptional and understand how higher education works in France.\nChat with our student ambassadors to hear directly from them\u2014ask any questions you have!\nDive into our student blog for firsthand insights on academic and campus life, along with valuable admission tips.\nExplore our student stories and learn about their academic experiences and journeys at PSL\nStep 6 | Prepare for your journey\nCongratulations on your admission to PSL! It\u2019s time to prepare for your exciting journey, and we\u2019re here to support you every step of the way as you begin this path to success.\nThe PSL Welcome Desk offers personalized assistance with all your administrative formalities, from visa applications and health insurance to other essential paperwork, both before and during your stay at PSL.\nThe PSL Housing Service is here to help you find the perfect place to live in Paris.\nTo enrich your experience, our Buddy Program and Tandem Program (language exchange) connect you with peers, offering a chance to immerse yourself in Parisian life and culture.\nGot questions about campus life, living in Paris, or why students choose PSL?\nOur students are here to chat and share their experiences!\nYou might find these blog posts interesting!\nArticle | Choosing to study in France: the thrills and the trials\nArticle | How important is it to know French?\nArticle | My Etudes en France experience with Campus France\nDiscover\nPSL University\nStay informed\nContact form\nFind your course\nBy education level\nBy education level\nBachelor's\nMaster's\nPhD\nOther\nBy discipline\nBy discipline\nAnthropology\nArcheology\nArchitecture\nArchives \u2013 Documentation\nArt History\nArts\nAstronomie\nAstrophysics\nBanking - Finance - Insurance\nBiologie\nBiology\nBusiness Administration - Management\nChemistry\nCognitive science\nCommunications - Journalism\nComputer Science\nData Science\nDigital Humanities\nDrama\nEarth sciences\nEarth sciences\nEcology\nEconomics\nEngineering Science\nEntrepreneurship\nFashion and design\nFinance\nGeosciences\nG\u00e9ographie\nG\u00e9ographie politique\nG\u00e9osciences\nHealth - Medecine\nHistory\nHuman Resources\nLanguages\nLaw\nLife Sciences\nLiterature\nManagement\nMarketing\nMathematics\nMechanics and Materials\nM\u00e9decine\nPhilosophy\nPhysics\nPlastic Arts\nPolitical Science\nProgramming\nQuantum engineering\nReligious sciences\nSciences du climat\nSocial Science\nSociology\nSpace Science\nSustainable development\nSearch\nBack to school brochure 2025\nWelcome to PSL !\nDownload\nAny question ?\nGet in touch with a student ambassador\nClick here\nStudent stories\nRead more\nMain navigation\nUniversity\nAbout us\nSchools\nInternational rankings\nOrganization\nNews\nPariSant\u00